 - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison) Concerto Regen","mult":[{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"},{"kind":"raw","text":"10"}],"extra":[]}]},{"node":"7","type":"Forte Circuit","name":"Bound Obsession, Forged Mind","desc":"Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion\nWhile in the Awakened Mind state, when Delusion reaches {0} points, Resonance Skill is replaced with Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion, dealing Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into Deep Mind and clears all Delusion.\n\nResonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind\nWhile in the Deep Mind state, when Delusion reaches {1} points, Resonance Skill is replaced with Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind, pulling in nearby targets and dealing Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n\nBasic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart\nWithin a certain period after casting Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind, Basic Attack and Resonance Skill are replaced with Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold Normal Attack or Resonance Skill to cast this skill. Attack targets within range, dealing Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into Calamity Mind and clears all Delusion; she enters Awakened Mind once the skill ends.\n- When casting this skill, hold Normal Attack or Resonance Skill to continuously attack the target for a certain period.\n- While casting this skill, Suoming is immune to DMG and interruption for a certain period.\n- During the skill action, she cannot move, dash, jump, dodge, or cast Basic Attack, Resonance Skill, Resonance Liberation, Dodge Counter, Plunging Attack, Mid-air Attack, or Intro Skill, and Resonator switching is also restricted.\n\nUnison\nWhen Suoming has Unison, switching to another Resonator will remove her Unison to trigger Suoming's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. When Suoming's Concerto Energy is full and she has Unison, only the Unison effect is consumed.\n\nUnison Response\nSuoming can trigger Unison Response.\nWhen the active Resonator in the team has Unison, Suoming triggers Unison Response after she is switched in and casts Intro Skill, granting all Resonators in the team {2} {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=2} of Unison Boon for {3}s.\nSuoming can grant up to {4} {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of Unison Boon. Gaining it again only resets the duration.\nUnison Response cannot be triggered in Co-op.\n\nUnison Boon\nOnly the Resonators who can trigger Unison Response can gain this effect. Each stack of Unison Boon increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators in the team who can trigger Unison Response by {5}, up to {6} stacks.\n\nDelusion\nCan hold up to {7} points of Delusion.\n- Hitting a target with Basic Attack, Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy, Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder, Dodge Counter, Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy, or Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam grants Delusion if Suoming is the active Resonator.\n- Casting Resonance Liberation grants {8} {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=8} of Delusion.\n- Casting Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending or Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison) grants {9} {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=9} of Delusion.","rows":[{"name":"Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[31.58,2],[15.79,4]]},{"kind":"pct","hits"